Duris is a derivative of DikuMUD. Two notices apply to this repository.

1. The original DikuMUD license, reproduced unmodified below, covers everything
   that descends from DikuMUD. It travels with the code as is, the authors'
   names stay in the login sequence and in the credits command, and no part of
   the combined work may be sold or otherwise used for profit.

2. Everything added to or changed from the original DikuMUD, by the Duris
   maintainers and, as far as the maintainers know, by their predecessors, is
   released into the public domain under the Unlicense, reproduced after the
   DikuMUD license. That dedication covers only those additions and changes;
   the combined work remains bound by the DikuMUD terms above. Where a file's
   origin is unknown, treat it as DikuMUD-derived.

Third-party components keep their own notices where they appear in the tree,
for example areas/de/license.txt.

